                <mxCell id="118" value="Recorremos la colección buecando si hay personas dentro del List y si hay&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre; color: rgb(156, 220, 254);&quot;&gt;pasajeros&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre; color: rgb(212, 212, 212);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre; color: rgb(210, 168, 255);&quot;&gt;Remove&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(187, 190, 191); font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre; color: rgb(255, 166, 87);&quot;&gt;persona&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(187, 190, 191); font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=note2;boundedLbl=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=0;verticalAlign=top;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1">
